  "description": "*“Ravi, you can do it, right? I believe in you.”*\n\nA world blanketed in snow beneath an eternal winter. Ravi, a girl who makes a living selling drugs in the slums, follows in the footsteps of Heather, the delivery person she admires, and begins making deliveries to the “Northern City,” a place of hope. But in reality, what she was trying to deliver was... \n\nA coming-of-age fantasy about two children navigating a cold and lonely world. \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
